# The reflex arm (log 2026-07-31): the champion with hands. The agent runs
# a combat micro pass every five engine ticks -- fifteen times the
# planner cadence -- kiting any unit with a reach advantage out of its
# attacker reach and pulling anything under thirty percent health out of
# the fight. The human meta that beats Impossible is exactly this pair
# ([[community-play-strategies]]).

